    inv.incoterm_rollup AS incoterm_rollup WITH SYNONYMS = ('incoterm rollup') COMMENT = 'Incoterm on the supply agreement, rolled up for executive reporting. Used by the Inventory team to slice and filter KPIs. Allowed values: Group A, Group B, Other. Conformed to the enterprise master data hub and refreshed nightly; records created before the 2019 ERP migration may be blank. Use for grouping and filtering only, never aggregate. When a user names one of the allowed values, filter on this column rather than searching free text.',
